    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Corry Estates are delighted to welcome to the market No. 106 Ardilaun, a bright and spacious four bedroom semi-detached family home with the added benefits of a garage conversion along with a large south facing rear garden which is not over looked. Further features include PVC double glazed windows, modern bathroom suite and gas fired radiator central heating. The property has been very well maintained by its current owners and comprising of porch entrance, reception hall, playroom / office, a living room with double doors that lead to the dining room, kitchen and guest w.c. The first floor comprises of four double bedrooms and a family bathroom. Perfectly positioned within a mature tree lined development Ardilaun is just minutes` walk from local shops, both primary and secondary schools, Portmarnock Leisure Centre with a host of sports clubs, local GAA club and Portmarnock`s famous beach. Portmarnock Dart station is also within very close proximity. Viewing of this spacious family home comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch Entrance:\r\n1.01m (3'4\") x 1.77m (5'10\") tiled floor.\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\n4.73m (15'6\") x 1.76m (5'9\") Laminate floor.\r\nGuest w.c & w.h.b. Laminate flooring.  \r\n\r\nLiving Room:\r\n4.66m (15'3\") x 3.45m (11'4\") Slate fireplace with timber surround and open fire. TV point. Laminate flooring. Double doors lead to:\r\n\r\nDining Room:\r\n3.04m (10'0\") x 3.43m (11'3\") Laminate flooring. Sliding door to sunny south facing rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\n3.01m (9'11\") x 4.13m (13'7\") Range of fitted press units. Laminate flooring. Tiled behind worktop. Plumbed for dishwasher.\r\n\r\nFamily Room:\r\n3.74m x 2.20m Built in shelving units. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\n1st Floor:\r\n\r\nLanding:\r\n2.86m (9'5\") x 1.93m (6'4\") Access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\n2.59m (8'6\") x 4.02m (13'2\") Laminate flooring. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n3.65m (12'0\") x 3.16m (10'4\") Built in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3:\r\n4.09m (13'5\") x 3.31m (10'10\") Built in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4:\r\n3.55m (11'8\") x 2.35m (7'9\") Built in wardrobes. Laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n2.02m (6'8\") x 1.92m (6'4\") Modern suite comprising of w.c. & w.h.b., and shower. Fully tiled.\r\n\r\nOutside: Long south facing rear garden with Patio area.\r\nEnclosed side entrance which is ideal for storage. \r\nOff street driveway parking."
      },
